# Compel Brutality, second mode: "Target planeswalker you control deals damage equal to its loyalty to target creature or
# planeswalker an opponent controls." Loyalty is the loyalty counters it has as the spell resolves (CR 306.5b, 608.2c): Bot1's
# Liliana of the Veil enters with 3 and +1s on turn 3 to 4 (each player discards), so she deals 4, not 3, to Bot2's Oko (loyalty
# 4), which has none left and goes to the graveyard (CR 704.5i). The first target refuses Bot1's own Ornithopter (a creature, not
# a planeswalker) beside the positive control of Liliana. The damage is dealt by Liliana, one-sided: she keeps her 4.

